We are inviting enthusiastic blogger writer from all around the globe. I know there are so many good writers and developers in the world. So in the search of a good content writer as well as the content analysis handler. we are going to conduct a healthy competition for all the writers with the given topic niche. Join us now and become the part of the TechnologyManias.

<!--more-->

## **The process of joining TechnologyManias**

&nbsp;

We are going to conduct the a healthy competition between all the applicants from around the globe. A simple online 60 minutes task needs to be submitted by applicant. It&#8217;s a golden opportunity for those who really wanted to make their career as blogger. Because the biggest portal of the asian market [Harlogs Technology][1] is now now collaging into a single unit.

To become the part of this brand you must need to submit a single task and That&#8217;s it ! After the selections completed winner/selected applicant will surely get a surprise gift from TechnologyManias.

Link for the Task will be announced on 10th of April 2021 through email to all the interested application.

#### Eligibility :

  1. Age criteria : Must be 18+
  2. Location : Globe
  3. Languages : Must be English
  4. Topics : will be sent in mail

#### The Task :

  1. Writing the neat and clean content on the given niche/topic
  2. Writing methods must includes Introduction, History, Analysis and Conclusion
  3. Only accepts 100% original content
  4. Do not submit multiple tasks

#### Result :

The result will be announced on 20th of April 2021 on the website. Selected writer will get the surprise gift from us.

So what are you waiting for ? Just share this article with all the writer and blogger in your contact. We do not accepts the email that is being send after 9th April 2021 11:59 PM.

**Kindly ping us on join@[technoogymanias.com][2]**.

In case of any difficulty you can contact us on +91 9638442049 or **support@technologymanias.com**

